Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2: see LICENSE.

The Polyfin image contains jellyfin-web 12.4, unmodified, as a separate
program, in /usr/share/polyfin/jellyfin-web: its built files, copied from
the official jellyfin/jellyfin:12.4 image. Its complete source code is
attached to every Polyfin release on GitHub, as
jellyfin-web-12.4-source.tar.gz, and is also at
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-web/tree/v12.4

Polyfin is a separate program, released under the MIT License. It serves
these files at /web/ and adds to the page one script of its own,
/web/polyfin.js, which is under Polyfin's license.
